cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ARNOLD: KAN Layers for Keras"
abstract: >-
  ARNOLD is a comprehensive library of Kolmogorov-Arnold Network (KAN) layers
  for Keras. It provides polynomial, radial basis function, and wavelet-based
  basis implementations with a focus on numerical stability, XLA compilation,
  and production-ready deployment.
authors:
